Package: hfdCohortFertilityTable
Type: Package
Title: Production of Cohort Fertility Tables using the HFD methodology
Version: 2.0-1077
Date: 2015-04-26
Imports: utils
Depends: abind
Author: Edward Nash <nash@demogr.mpg.de>
Maintainer: Edward Nash <edward.nash@gmx.de>
Description: This package provides a number of functions to enable demographers
